==Battleground==
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The peons, compared to some other levels, aren't too threatening. Try to stall as well as possible in order to be fully prepared for both Ryu and Ken. Ken is the main threat of this level, with his Omni-Strike, Knockback and high stats. Thankfully, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] stands at a safe distance from him, even with his Omni. General tank units are helpful here as well, as they can withstand a number of hits, and deal some damage themselves.

